				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				175
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχένες, δέμας</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1200
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1203
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρέτρα</span>
